ss had something to do  with it when liv takes an arrow in the  shoulder and her chances of pulling  through seems slim he secretly leaves  the cross with her she also survives  there are several little moments that  hint at late moving away from pagan  beliefs and embracing christianity some  more subtle than others when yarohokan  sanctions a human sacrifice as they  prepare to defend cataget others watch  in awe as the volunteer is killed while  the look on late space suggests that  he's uncomfortable at best ragnar  flirted with christianity during his  lifetime and it appears as though lake  will do the same  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite television shows are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  [Music]  you

